    "details": "The Erlang/OTP team reports:\n\n> Fixed a bug where zip:unzip/1,2 and zip:extract/1,2 were vulnerable to\n> a relative path traversal attack. A crafted zip archive containing\n> entry names such as ../x/y could have caused files to be written\n> outside the intended extraction directory.\n",
